# DECSCA 1 protects the characters printed after it, and DECSCA 0 and 2
# end the protection. DECSEL and DECSED erase every character that is
# not protected and leave the protected ones.
# spec: the VT510 manual, DECSCA, DECSED and DECSEL
# covers: ctl.protect
size 6 3
send "aa\e[1\"qPP\e[0\"qaa\r\nbbbbbb"
dump state
send "\e[1;1H\e[?K"
dump state
send "\e[?J"
dump state
send "\e[1;1Hxx\e[1\"qPP\e[2\"qxx\e[1;1H\e[?2J"
dump state
